  "notes": "Function table drawn around physical 2x18 header numbering (Rev A2a). Label = cell adjacent to the pin number (GPIO number as printed without prefix, power/system name, or AIN channel number); functions = other cells read outward, omitting the category-only group tags GPIO, SYS, BAT and bare PRU. Group cells spanning several rows (e.g. SPI0, USB1, AIN 1.8V) are repeated for each pin they cover. Hatched (unused) cells skipped. P2.12 printed on two lines as \"PWR BTN\"."
